{"id":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-lichnerowicz-dimension-estimate","title":"thm:pet-ch9-lichnerowicz-dimension-estimate","path":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique.md","line":263,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique.tex#thm:pet-ch9-lichnerowicz-dimension-estimate","uses":["[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#cor:pet-ch9-ric-nonneg-curvature-operator]]","[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate]]","[[references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique#prop:pet-ch9-vanishing-connection-laplacian]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Petersen/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_TheBochnerTechnique.tex","label":"thm:pet-ch9-lichnerowicz-dimension-estimate","line":582,"source":"\\begin{theorem}[dimension estimate for Lichnerowicz-harmonic tensors]\n  \\label{thm:pet-ch9-lichnerowicz-dimension-estimate}\n\n  \\source{petersen:page-0360}\n  \\uses{cor:pet-ch9-ric-nonneg-curvature-operator, thm:pet-ch9-gallot-connection-laplacian-estimate, prop:pet-ch9-vanishing-connection-laplacian}\n  \\dcref{ch9:9.3.5}\n  Suppose $\\mathfrak R\\ge k$ and $\\operatorname{diam}M\\le D$, and set\n  \\[\n    V=\\ker\\Delta_L\n      =\\{T\\in\\Gamma(E):\\nabla^*\\nabla T+c\\operatorname{Ric}(T)=0\\}.\n  \\]\n  Then\n  \\[\n    \\dim V\\le\n    m\\cdot\\exp\\Big(2D\\cdot C(n,kD^2)\n      \\frac{\\sqrt{-kcC\\nu}}{\\sqrt{\\nu-1}}\\Big).\n  \\]\n  If $k=0$, all elements of $V$ are parallel.\n\\end{theorem}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section>[dimension estimate for Lichnerowicz-harmonic tensors] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-74686d3a7065742d6368392d6c6963686e65726f